ses :\n{{answers}}","it_IT":"Nuova voce da «{{form:title}}».\n\n{{lead}}\n\nRisposte:\n{{answers}}"},"nl2br":true,"transport":{"type":"wp_mail"},"layout":"branded"}},{"id":"a_reply","on":"submit","kind":"autoresponder","config":{"to":{"en_US":"{{field:email}}","de_DE":"{{field:email}}","de_DE_formal":"{{field:email}}","es_ES":"{{field:email}}","fr_FR":"{{field:email}}","it_IT":"{{field:email}}"},"cc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"bcc":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"from":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"fromName":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"replyTo":{"en_US":"","de_DE":"","de_DE_formal":"","es_ES":"","fr_FR":"","it_IT":""},"subject":{"en_US":"We have received your request","de_DE":"Wir haben deine Anfrage erhalten","de_DE_formal":"Wir haben Ihre Anfrage erhalten","es_ES":"Hemos recibido tu solicitud","fr_FR":"Nous avons bien reçu votre demande","it_IT":"Abbiamo ricevuto la tua richiesta"},"body":{"en_US":"Hello {{field:name}},\n\nthank you for your request. We have received your details and will get back to you within one working day.\n\nWhat happens now?\n1. We read your wishes.\n2. We call you within one working day to fix your planning appointment.\n3. In the studio we plan your kitchen in 3D, free of charge. Bring a floor plan or measurements.\n\nYour answers:\n{{answers}}\n\nKind regards","de_DE":"Hallo {{field:name}},\n\nvielen Dank für deine Anfrage. Wir haben deine Angaben erhalten und melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags.\n\nWas passiert jetzt?\n1. Wir lesen deine Wünsche.\n2. Wir rufen innerhalb eines Werktags an und vereinbaren deinen Planungstermin.\n3. Im Studio planen wir deine Küche kostenlos in 3D. Grundriss oder Maße gern mitbringen.\n\nDeine Angaben:\n{{answers}}\n\nViele Grüße","de_DE_formal":"Hallo {{field:name}},\n\nvielen Dank für Ihre Anfrage. Wir haben Ihre Angaben erhalten und melden uns innerhalb eines Werktags.\n\nWas passiert jetzt?\n1. Wir lesen Ihre Wünsche.\n2. Wir rufen innerhalb eines Werktags an und vereinbaren Ihren Planungstermin.\n3. Im Studio planen wir Ihre Küche kostenlos in 3D. Grundriss oder Maße gern mitbringen.\n\nIhre Angaben:\n{{answers}}\n\nViele Grüße","es_ES":"Hola, {{field:name}}:\n\ngracias por tu solicitud. Hemos recibido tus datos y te responderemos en un día laborable.\n\n¿Qué pasa ahora?\n1. Leemos tus deseos.\n2. Te llamamos en un día laborable para fijar la cita.\n3. En el estudio diseñamos tu cocina en 3D gratis. Trae un plano o medidas.\n\nTus respuestas:\n{{answers}}\n\nUn saludo","fr_FR":"Bonjour {{field:name}},\n\nmerci pour votre demande. Nous avons bien reçu vos informations et revenons vers vous sous un jour ouvré.\n\nEt maintenant ?\n1. Nous lisons vos souhaits.\n2. Nous vous appelons sous un jour ouvré pour fixer le rendez-vous.\n3. Au studio, nous concevons votre cuisine en 3D gratuitement. Apportez un plan ou vos mesures.\n\nVos réponses :\n{{answers}}\n\nBien cordialement","it_IT":"Ciao {{field:name}},\n\ngrazie per la tua richiesta. Abbiamo ricevuto i tuoi dati e ti risponderemo entro un giorno lavorativo.\n\nE adesso?\n1. Leggiamo i tuoi desideri.\n2. Ti chiamiamo entro un giorno lavorativo per fissare l’appuntamento.\n3. In studio progettiamo la tua cucina in 3D gratis. Porta una pianta o le misure.\n\nLe tue risposte:\n{{answers}}\n\nCordiali saluti"},"nl2br":true,"transport":{"type":"wp_mail"},"layout":"branded","recipientField":"c_email"}}],"style":{"preset":"default","theme":"editorial","tokens":{"color.primary":"#7a2e3b","color.onPrimary":"#ffffff","color.background":"#fbf9f6","color.text":"#1f1d1a","color.muted":"#5c574f","color.border":"#e2dcd2","color.error":"#b42318","font.family":"serif-classic","radius.card":"4","radius.input":"2","font.heading":"serif-modern","font.weight.heading":"normal","color.optionSelected":"#f5ecea","color.icon":"#7a2e3b","radius.button":"2","